---
import CitySchema from "../../components/CitySchema.astro";
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  fullTitle="Best Shanghai Restaurants in London — Top Picks"
  description="Discover the best Shanghai restaurants in London. 14 top-rated spots for xiaolongbao, dim sum, and authentic Shanghainese cuisine."
  hreflang={[{ lang: "en-gb", href: "https://shanghai-restaurant.com/shanghai-restaurant-london" }]}
>
  <main>
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-20 md:pt-28 pb-12">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl tracking-tighter leading-none font-semibold text-slate-900">
          Shanghai Restaurants in London
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-[60ch]">
          London's Shanghai restaurant scene is anchored in Chinatown and the East End, with newer spots spreading to Soho and Shoreditch. The city's cosmopolitan dining culture has embraced Shanghainese cuisine with particular enthusiasm for dim sum and fine dining interpretations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 pb-24">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-6">Featured Listings</h2>
      <div class="card-soft bg-slate-50 p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl text-slate-600 font-medium">14 Shanghai Restaurants</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-500 mt-2">Our full London guide is coming soon with detailed reviews, menus, and photos.</p>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <a href="/best-shanghai-restaurants" class="btn-soft bg-accent-600 hover:bg-accent-700 text-white text-sm font-medium px-6 py-3 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2">Browse All Restaurants</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <CitySchema city="London" count={14} slug="london" />
</Layout>